Definitions
-----------
  message_delay_ms        = db_insert_time - message_creation_time (per message)
  position_in_window      = row index 0..59 within a 1-min Flink tumbling window
  analytic_window_wait_ms = (59 - position_in_window) * 1000
                            i.e. the deterministic floor imposed by a 60-s window
                            with forBoundedOutOfOrderness = 0 s
  processing_overhead_ms  = message_delay_ms - analytic_window_wait_ms
                            i.e. infrastructure overhead above the window floor

