7. ANOMALIES TO REVIEW BEFORE PUBLISHING
============================================================================================
  - architecture1_3d_run_logs.log has 60 duplicate timestamps (600 rows but only
    540 distinct sensor_timestamps) and only 10 windows captured.  Likely early
    termination or Flink re-emission.  Consider re-running or discarding.
